      "answer": {
        "text": "### Source, Version, and Scope\n- **User-supplied facts:** Unit name \"Wardens of Ultramar\".\n- **Tool-established facts:** Datasheet lookup joining the unit's datasheet [DB: datasheets], model profiles [DB: datasheets_models], and publication source [DB: source].\n- **Recorded publication & edition:** \n  - **Publication (Source):** Space Marines [DB: source]\n  - **Edition:** 11 [DB: source]\n\n---\n\n### Model Profiles and Toughness\n\nThe unit **Wardens of Ultramar** (Space Marines, Datasheet ID `000004188`) contains two distinct model profiles [DB: datasheets, datasheets_models]:\n\n1. **Ancient Gadriel, Veteran Sergeant Metaurus** (line 1)\n   - **Toughness (T):** 4 [DB: datasheets_models]\n2. **Gaius Silva, Aemelia Minervas, Dainal Kornelius, Lucia Vestha** (line 2)\n   - **Toughness (T):** 3 [DB: datasheets_models]\n\n---\n\n### Conclusion\n- **Publication:** Space Marines [DB: source]\n- **Edition:** 11 [DB: source]\n- **Toughness by Profile:**\n  - Ancient Gadriel, Veteran Sergeant Metaurus: **T4** [DB: datasheets_models]\n  - Gaius Silva, Aemelia Minervas, Dainal Kornelius, Lucia Vestha: **T3** [DB: datasheets_models]\n- **Evidence Gap:** None; all requested profile characteristics and publication fields are fully recorded.",
        "source_notes": [
          "This turn: Database publication for Wardens of Ultramar (ID 000004188): Space Marines; edition 11."
        ],
        "database_statistics": [],
        "answered": true,
        "finish_reason": "STOP",
        "tool_calls": [
          {
            "name": "run_sql",
            "arguments": {
              "sql": "SELECT d.Id, d.name, f.name AS faction, m.name AS model, m.line, m.t,\n       s.name AS source, s.edition\nFROM datasheets d\nJOIN factions f ON f.Id = d.factionId\nJOIN datasheets_models m ON m.DatasheetId = d.Id\nLEFT JOIN source s ON s.Id = d.sourceId\nWHERE d.name LIKE '%Wardens of Ultramar%'\nORDER BY CAST(m.line AS INTEGER);"
            },
